Omitted scenes, the final design — collapsed, not struck. Collapsed by default: the cut scene is out of the script's flow, one calm line in its place — SCENE 21 OMITTED in a muted sepia-brown, with a pill reading the cut length and a disclosure control, "View Cut Text". Expanded on demand: the body renders in the same muted sepia, keeping its scene number, bounded by a dotted rule. Caret and edits still refused; selection and copy still allowed. The struck-through attribute path is replaced, not kept as a fallback.